#
#Thu Oct 08 17:24:54 KST 2026
classes\ that\ are\ annotated\ with\ @RestController\ should\ implement\ {Domain}Api\ interface,\ because\ Swagger\ \uBB38\uC11C\uB294\ {Domain}Api\ \uC778\uD130\uD398\uC774\uC2A4\uC5D0\ \uB454\uB2E4\ (controller-api.md\ 2\uBC88)=d1dc6fcd-fd78-48d7-8ae2-266f5d78cf50
classes\ that\ are\ annotated\ with\ @Service\ and\ use\ @Transactional\ should\ be\ annotated\ with\ @Transactional(readOnly\ \=\ true)\ at\ class\ level,\ because\ \uD074\uB798\uC2A4\uB294\ readOnly,\ \uC4F0\uAE30\ \uBA54\uC11C\uB4DC\uB9CC\ @Transactional\uB85C\ \uB36E\uC5B4\uC4F4\uB2E4\ (service-transaction.md\ 2\uBC88)=f4f432ac-7045-4870-9618-342e91f6b7e3
classes\ that\ implement\ com.bready.server.global.exception.ErrorCase\ and\ are\ enums\ should\ have\ globally\ unique\ error\ codes,\ because\ \uC5D0\uB7EC\ \uCF54\uB4DC\uB294\ \uC804\uC5ED\uC5D0\uC11C\ \uC720\uC77C\uD574\uC57C\ \uD55C\uB2E4\ (exception.md\ 2\uBC88)=e6c4722a-4af5-4de9-a764-c7fbb61ca940
classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ '..dto..'\ and\ are\ top\ level\ classes\ and\ are\ not\ enums\ should\ be\ a\ record\ named\ *Request\ or\ *Response,\ because\ DTO\uB294\ {Resource}{Action}Request/Response\ record\uB2E4\ (dto.md\ 1\u00B72\uBC88)=8895fb0b-0970-4fec-818c-c23e4a6bd6e6
constructors\ that\ are\ declared\ in\ classes\ that\ are\ annotated\ with\ @Entity\ and\ have\ no\ parameters\ should\ not\ be\ public,\ because\ \uC5D4\uD2F0\uD2F0\uB294\ @NoArgsConstructor(access\ \=\ PROTECTED)\ +\ \uC815\uC801\ \uD329\uD1A0\uB9AC\uB85C\uB9CC\ \uB9CC\uB4E0\uB2E4\ (entity.md\ 1\uBC88)=ab24705f-a921-44d3-9c3a-21bf059b0c30
fields\ that\ are\ declared\ in\ classes\ that\ are\ annotated\ with\ @Entity\ and\ are\ of\ enum\ type\ should\ be\ annotated\ with\ @Enumerated(EnumType.STRING),\ because\ ORDINAL\uC740\ enum\ \uC21C\uC11C\uAC00\ \uBC14\uB00C\uBA74\ \uB370\uC774\uD130\uAC00\ \uAE68\uC9C4\uB2E4\ (entity.md\ 5\uBC88)=4623f220-ef39-4aec-8866-5fdedf0c8e5e
methods\ that\ are\ annotated\ with\ @Transactional\ should\ not\ be\ private,\ because\ \uD504\uB85D\uC2DC\uB97C\ \uAC70\uCE58\uC9C0\ \uC54A\uB294\ private\ \uBA54\uC11C\uB4DC\uC5D0\uC11C\uB294\ @Transactional\uC774\ \uBB34\uC2DC\uB41C\uB2E4\ (service-transaction.md\ 8\uBC88)=680571ca-1ecc-4e9b-80fb-892bf309991a
methods\ that\ are\ declared\ in\ classes\ that\ are\ annotated\ with\ @Entity\ and\ have\ name\ matching\ 'set[A-Z].*'\ should\ not\ be\ public,\ because\ \uC0C1\uD0DC\ \uBCC0\uACBD\uC740\ \uC758\uB3C4\uB97C\ \uB4DC\uB7EC\uB0B4\uB294\ \uBA54\uC11C\uB4DC\uB85C\ \uD55C\uB2E4\ (entity.md\ 3\uBC88)=bdb2a051-fd4a-4687-880c-a856aa67fadb
no\ classes\ should\ access\ standard\ streams,\ because\ \uCD9C\uB825\uC740\ \uB85C\uAC70\uB85C\uB9CC\ \uD55C\uB2E4\ (logging.md)=640a7ee4-03b8-450b-a204-ade206e4e1aa
no\ classes\ should\ call\ constructor\ where\ create\ an\ event\ class\ of\ another\ module,\ because\ \uC774\uBCA4\uD2B8\ \uD074\uB798\uC2A4\uB294\ \uBC1C\uD589\uD558\uB294\ \uBAA8\uB4C8\uC774\ \uC18C\uC720\uD55C\uB2E4\ (service-transaction.md\ 6\uBC88,\ msa-boundary.md\ V5)=247b7860-8fbb-4980-ae6f-6ad2224cdc79
no\ classes\ should\ use\ field\ injection,\ because\ field\ injection\ is\ considered\ harmful;\ use\ constructor\ injection\ or\ setter\ injection\ instead;\ see\ https\://stackoverflow.com/q/39890849\ for\ detailed\ explanations,\ because\ \uC0DD\uC131\uC790\ \uC8FC\uC785\uB9CC\ \uC4F4\uB2E4\ (@RequiredArgsConstructor)=836125f5-e476-4515-8606-f8e93abf17ca
no\ classes\ that\ do\ not\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'com.bready.server.global.exception.ApplicationException'\ should\ call\ constructor\ ApplicationException.<init>(ErrorCase)\ or\ should\ call\ constructor\ ApplicationException.<init>(ErrorCase,\ Throwable),\ because\ \uC608\uC678\uB294\ ApplicationException.from(...)\uC73C\uB85C\uB9CC\ \uB9CC\uB4E0\uB2E4\ (exception.md\ 3\uBC88)=3cb73128-ec59-4810-9234-9a9591be6e88
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ '..controller..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ '..repository..',\ because\ \uCEE8\uD2B8\uB864\uB7EC\uB294\ \uC11C\uBE44\uC2A4\uC5D0\ \uC704\uC784\uB9CC\ \uD55C\uB2E4\ (controller-api.md\ 1\uBC88)=a2521a54-ddc8-4de1-91a1-edeb67c07dab
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ '..domain..'\ should\ call\ constructor\ IllegalArgumentException.<init>(String)\ or\ should\ call\ constructor\ IllegalStateException.<init>(String),\ because\ \uB3C4\uBA54\uC778\ \uADDC\uCE59\ \uC704\uBC18\uC740\ ErrorCase\uB85C\ \uB358\uC9C4\uB2E4.\ \uD45C\uC900\ \uC608\uC678\uB294\ 500\uC774\ \uB41C\uB2E4\ (entity.md\ 2\uBC88)=ad6fddab-32de-4f3e-afd0-b68404b85dbf
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ '..domain..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['..dto..',\ '..service..',\ '..controller..'],\ because\ \uBCC0\uD658\uC740\ DTO\uC758\ from()\uC774\ \uB9E1\uACE0\ \uC758\uC874\uC740\ dto\ \u2192\ domain\ \uD55C\uCABD\uBFD0\uC774\uB2E4\ (dto.md\ 4\uBC88)=f018ab89-e834-4c5b-b119-a4bd6ed6ec74
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ '..repository..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ '..service..',\ because\ \uC758\uC874\uC740\ controller\ \u2192\ service\ \u2192\ repository\ \uD55C\ \uBC29\uD5A5\uC774\uB2E4=a82f5b5f-9275-4b69-9bd1-d0b87e63af7b
